        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Large numbers of star rain Gu, small numbers of spring wind Gu, and many other Gu assemble Spring Star Rain, which increases plant growth. Fang Yuan uses it many times to nourish star fragment grass.",
